  "10.20.40.40(1)": {
   "explanation": "In the RD zone the maximum floor space index is the \"d\" number on the zone label; with no \"d\" number there is no FSI limit. Detached houseplexes, houses with a secondary suite, and townhouses or apartment buildings of up to 60 units on a major street are exempt.",
